Modified on 2026-10-08 for a user-requested, undeployed architecture draft:
four independent dilated-convolution DNA inputs, 2554 regulatory features,
1536-channel adapters, and a signed scalar readout. Other adaptations and
limitations are listed in README.md. This is not the author's released model.

Further user-requested change on 2026-10-08: Transformer depth reduced from
nine to three. Retained FiLM at block 3 only; removed the former block-6 site
and reduced the Transformer FiLM generator output dimension accordingly.

Further user-requested change on 2026-10-08: replaced per-region pointwise
scalar readout and equal averaging with mean pooling of Transformer features,
four-region feature concatenation, and one 6144 -> 256 -> 1 regression head.
No cross-region attention, raw DNA concatenation or direct regulator embedding
concatenation was added. This remains an undeployed local draft.

Further user-requested ablation on 2026-10-08: all Transformer/FlashAttention
definitions, calls and their dedicated FiLM MLP removed in this separate
experiment. Convolution FiLM, projections and pooled feature-concat head retained.
Training is authorized in an independent directory; original data remain unchanged.
